Implement org.freedesktop.ScreenSaver.GetSessionIdleTime (milliseconds since
the last input, like KDE) from a 1-second ext-idle-notify notification.
Steam polls it to decide when the user is Away; without it, Steam only saw
input to its own windows and went Away while other programs were in use.

